{
 "_comment": "Bases, affixes and drop rules. Every base has an itemClass (itemClasses); an affix only rolls on the classes or class groups in its 'on' list, so bonuses make sense for the item (no blade skills on a bow, no attack speed on boots, no movement speed on gloves). Uniques and set items are hand-made (uniques, sets) and ignore those rules: same base, name and lines every time, only min–max ranges roll. guardEfficiency (shields) reduces the Energy spent per block; blockReduction (shields) adds to the share of a blocked hit the guard stops (balance.json guard). level = minimum item level (iLvl) for the base/affix to appear. size = inventory cells [width, height]. inventory = backpack grid (columns × rows); for now it limits how many items the character carries. startingGear = bases a new character wears; startingBackpack = bases it carries. twoHanded (bows, great weapons) = takes both hands: no shield and no second weapon. attackSpeedPct = the weapon's own attack speed (great weapons swing slower). Maces (itemClass mace, tag mace) feed Maces; great weapons (itemClass great, tag great) feed Two-Handed. rangeTiles = how far a bow shoots (14 tiles reach the edge of a 1280x720 screen). rareNames = parts of rare item names: '<first> <second>'. Wands (slot 'wand', worn in either hand: with a shield, or beside a weapon) carry a spell: while worn it adds spellLevel to that spell and lets you cast it even before you unlock it in the tree (skills.json). uniques/sets: props are {stat, value} (fixed) or {stat, min, max} (rolled when it drops); level = minimum item level; weight = how often it is picked among the allowed ones. A set's bonuses add up as more different pieces are worn (2 pieces, 3 pieces…).",
 "inventory": {
  "columns": 10,
  "rows": 6
 },
 "startingGear": ["short_sword", "buckler", "leather_armor"],
 "startingBackpack": ["short_bow", "ember_wand", "frost_wand", "spark_rod", "prayer_rod", "ward_rod"],
 "trade": {
  "_comment": "Vendor prices. Item price = (basePrice + perItemLevel x iLvl + perAffix x lines) x rarityMult[rarity] (normal, magic, rare, set, unique); the vendor pays sellFraction of that. The stock (stockSize items, normal and magic only, iLvl = character level) is rolled again every time you come to town. Consumables cost their own 'price'. npcRangeTiles = how close you must stand to trade or use the stash.",
  "basePrice": 20,
  "perItemLevel": 6,
  "perAffix": 25,
  "rarityMult": [1, 3, 8, 15, 20],
  "sellFraction": 0.2,
  "stockSize": 18,
  "npcRangeTiles": 3.0
 },
 "consumables": {
  "_comment": "Used from the HUD keys (ui/keys.json). restore = life | energy, pctOfMax of the maximum given over 'seconds' (several potions stack). cooldownSeconds = time before the same kind can be used again. belt = how many you carry is limited: beltWithout of each kind with no belt, plus the worn belt's beltSlots (a full belt leaves potions on the ground). price 0 = not sold. dropChance = rank → chance of one more when a monster of that rank dies (the Scroll of Forgetting, which gives back every point of one tree, is only found). The town portal is not an item: it is always available (balance.json townPortal).",
  "life_potion":   { "name": "Life Potion",   "restore": "life",   "pctOfMax": 0.4, "seconds": 2.0, "cooldownSeconds": 0.5, "price": 30, "belt": true },
  "energy_potion": { "name": "Energy Potion", "restore": "energy", "pctOfMax": 0.5, "seconds": 1.5, "cooldownSeconds": 0.5, "price": 30, "belt": true },
  "respec_scroll": { "name": "Scroll of Forgetting", "cooldownSeconds": 0.5, "price": 0, "dropChance": { "unique": 0.08, "boss": 0.5 } }
 },
 "beltWithout": 4,
 "equipment": {
  "_comment": "Equipment slots, in screen order. accepts = item slot types (bases' 'slot') that fit; the first one is the slot's own type, used when equipping with a double-click. offhand also takes a one-hand weapon: two weapons alternate their swings, but there is no guard and no Shield skills without a shield.",
  "head":     { "name": "Helm",       "accepts": ["head"] },
  "neck":     { "name": "Amulet",     "accepts": ["neck"] },
  "mainhand": { "name": "Weapon",     "accepts": ["mainhand", "wand"] },
  "body":     { "name": "Body Armor", "accepts": ["body"] },
  "offhand":  { "name": "Off Hand",   "accepts": ["offhand", "mainhand", "wand"] },
  "hands":    { "name": "Gloves",     "accepts": ["hands"] },
  "waist":    { "name": "Belt",       "accepts": ["waist"] },
  "ring1":    { "name": "Ring",       "accepts": ["ring"] },
  "ring2":    { "name": "Ring",       "accepts": ["ring"] },
  "feet":     { "name": "Boots",      "accepts": ["feet"] }
 },
 "slotNames": {"mainhand": "Weapon", "offhand": "Shield", "body": "Body Armor", "head": "Helm", "hands": "Gloves", "feet": "Boots", "waist": "Belt", "ring": "Ring", "neck": "Amulet", "wand": "Wand"},
 "rareNames": {
  "first": ["Ruin", "Fury", "Shadow", "Death", "Sorrow", "Storm", "Raven", "Moon", "Thorn", "Ember"],
